  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 604.03 Procedure for the Imposition of Sanctions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 604.03 Procedure for the Imposition of Sanctions. Other than the immediate suspension of licensure authorized by RSA 541-A:30, III, the board shall impose disciplinary sanctions only:\n\n(a) After prior notice to the licensee or certificate holder and the opportunity for him or her to be heard; or\n\n(b) By agreement in a settlement between the board and the licensee or certificate holder made pursuant to Saf-Mec 200.\n\nSource. #12385, eff 9-20-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-mec600.html"
}
